\begin{abstract}
This white paper presents a real-time, stability-certified multi-scale simulation
architecture integrating astrophysical tensor fields with genetic blueprint
dynamics. The system operates on a 64-node NVIDIA HGX H100 cluster and enforces
Lyapunov stability, sector dominance, and Control Barrier Function (CBF)
