utilization, ring-buffer latency, and Jacobian determinants. We derive closed-form
expressions for stability parameters $(\alpha, \beta, c_d, \gamma)$ directly from
hardware metrics and prove global asymptotic stability within the safe operating
region $\mathcal{R}_{\text{safe}}$.
\end{abstract}

